ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108454.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #107442 \r\n\r\nProblem seems to be receiving a close frame prematurely closes a websocket connection before all data frames may be read. I moved the state transition to STATE_CLOSING in poll() and ensured it only happens if there are no frames left to be read. I also made sure that if there are frames left to be read or sent, that it just returns from poll instead of continuing on and potentially prematurely closing the connection.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108454/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108454/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}